{"version":1,"content":"<p>以前，我用一個樣對人，覺得做人要夠真，這才對得住自己。</p><p>但其實，一個性格迎合不到所有人，問心無愧的結果，往往換來內耗。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;現在？</p><p>不會了。</p><p>我學會將遇到的人分類成兩種：行動派和吹水派。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.944568+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.129423+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.129423+00:00","content_hash":"62dc61ec8dbc8f4962137a74e777cf7e84618ed5e8e30ec995ededc0d9c4493e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}